    "code": "\tSELECTOR\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF isObjectNearby? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO PickUpObject\n\t\tELSE\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF isObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO MoveObjectToDesignatedArea\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tDO InspectObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF isPathClear? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO MoveTowardsObject\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO ScanAreaForObject\n\tEND\n"
